1
00:00:00,833 --> 00:00:02,700
Mom, Dad, what are you doing here

2
00:00:02,700 --> 00:00:03,233
Come in and sit down

3
00:00:03,266 --> 00:00:04,266
We're not going in

4
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:05,100
You two come out here

5
00:00:06,233 --> 00:00:07,433
Mom, Dad

6
00:00:08,066 --> 00:00:09,566
Why did you come here

7
00:00:09,900 --> 00:00:11,766
I won't waste any more breath

8
00:00:12,033 --> 00:00:14,300
Daniel owes two million to loan sharks

9
00:00:14,300 --> 00:00:15,833
You're paying for it

10
00:00:15,866 --> 00:00:17,966
I said I'm not giving him a dime

11
00:00:19,066 --> 00:00:19,766
Fine

12
00:00:28,433 --> 00:00:30,566
Everyone, come and look at this

13
00:00:30,833 --> 00:00:34,366
Lewes is driving his in-laws to their deaths

14
00:00:42,066 --> 00:00:42,866
What's going on

15
00:00:44,700 --> 00:00:46,833
I heard Lewes won't give his in-laws any money

16
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:48,466
The couple's about to drink poison

17
00:00:51,300 --> 00:00:52,500
If you don't pay up

18
00:00:52,866 --> 00:00:54,500
Your mom and I will drink this

19
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:03,400
Mom, Dad, stop this nonsense

20
00:01:03,400 --> 00:01:04,800
Give me that bottle

21
00:01:07,866 --> 00:01:08,766
Cynthia

22
00:01:09,600 --> 00:01:11,300
If you still care about us as parents

23
00:01:11,800 --> 00:01:13,866
Then convince Lewes to pay up

24
00:01:14,533 --> 00:01:15,166
Mom

25
00:01:15,300 --> 00:01:17,100
Everyone, judge for yourselves

26
00:01:17,433 --> 00:01:21,100
My brother-in-law spent millions on factories and land

27
00:01:21,200 --> 00:01:22,666
But for just two million

28
00:01:22,666 --> 00:01:24,666
He's driving his in-laws to suicide

29
00:01:27,866 --> 00:01:30,166
Lewes, if you don't pay up today

30
00:01:30,233 --> 00:01:34,500
I'll drink this and die at your doorstep

31
00:01:35,666 --> 00:01:36,466
Good Heavens

32
00:01:36,466 --> 00:01:38,400
Look at what's happening

33
00:01:38,433 --> 00:01:41,100
Lewes is rich but turns his back on his family

34
00:01:41,433 --> 00:01:44,666
He's just watching us die

35
00:01:48,233 --> 00:01:49,666
Mom, Dad, stop it

36
00:01:49,833 --> 00:01:51,866
I know exactly what kind of people you are

37
00:01:52,200 --> 00:01:53,300
You value your lives too much

38
00:01:53,300 --> 00:01:54,566
You'd never actually drink that
